<td align="center"><B>Deutsche Bank Natl. Trust Co. v LeTennier</B></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center">2026 NY Slip Op 00040</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center">Decided on January 8, 2026</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center">Appellate Division, Third Department</td>
